e=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id494120520"}, "name": {"label": "123allnamesaretaken123"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-10-19T04:57:23-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "1"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.14.1"}, "id": {"label": "14685189569"}, "title": {"label": "Game is a thief"}, "content": {"label": "This game is an absolute thief. After world one it takes all your coins and diamonds, and you have to start over. It has your basic world and level concept with the first world having about eight planes. Towards the end of world one I decided to save up some money for the next world, so it would be easier to get it kicked off.. At the end of world one you start world two with zero coins, and zero diamonds. I had not spent any actual cash on diamonds. The ones I had earned were through watching their dumb commercials, I did have a billion coins. But they\u2019re all gone, so I\u2019m gonna delete the app. I just wanted to warn everybody not to waste your time..", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6504122823&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum": {"label": "0"}, "im:contentType": {"attributes": {"term": "Application", "label": "Application"}}, "im:voteCount": {"label": "0"}}, {"author": {"uri": {"label": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1831639165"}, "name": {"label": "Zawg :)"}, "label": ""}, "updated": {"label": "2026-10-18T15:25:07-07:00"}, "im:rating": {"label": "5"}, "im:version": {"label": "1.14.1"}, "id": {"label": "14683302171"}, "title": {"label": "Good"}, "content": {"label": "Cool game", "attributes": {"type": "text"}}, "link": {"attributes": {"rel": "related", "href": "https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=6504122823&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSu